# Waking the Colossus's 929 options, one char each, every one accepted at Prog 5 with the Whisper (GMs), by Naja (no
# script, no default; no ToAU 48 here: a nil answers nothing). main holds the Colossus's Mantle and Torque: 929 [7] 5
# (bits 0 and 2); option 0: rewardItems[-1] is nil, npcUtil.giveItem(player, nil) returns true: completed with no pick
# (the title, an Imperial Gold Piece; the Whisper taken; DI's Timer 1). bob option 2: the Colossus's Earring, completed.
# carl option 3: the Torque, completed. dan option 4: 10000 gil (GIL_OBTAINED), completed. eve option 5: Alexander
# learnt, ALEXANDER_UNLOCKED (0, 0, 1), completed; her Naja again: completed: nothing. fay option 6: no reward arm:
# completed.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/929
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75
char carl zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75
char eve zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75
char fay zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 5
keyitem WhisperOfRadiance
item ColossussMantle
item ColossussTorque
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 5
bob: keyitem WhisperOfRadiance
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
